<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irruptĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		irrumpo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a breaking</i> or <i>bursting in</i>,
				<i>an irruption.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irruptionem facere in popinam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. prol. 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 12, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">luminis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 10, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 30, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp., as milit. t. t., <i>an invasion</i>, <i>incursion</i>, <i>sally</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">etiamsi irruptio facta nulla sit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Imp. Pomp. 6, 15</span></i>
			: Gallorum, Aug. Civ. Dei, 3, 31.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
